{
  "answer": "Mr. Darbey is an officer of the Hussars, and he is seen by The Dean and spoken to by Sheba when he and Major Tarver visit the Deanery. The Dean initially mistakes his name as 'Mr. Garvey' but Sheba corrects him, saying 'Mr. Darbey!', after which The Dean acknowledges him as 'Darbey!' and invites both men to dinner.",
